  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-black text-white\"><section class=\"relative pt-24 pb-8 md:pt-32 md:pb-16 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\"><img alt=\"Collection of classic cars\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" src=\"/assets/estate-leads/hero-76b2d773.webp\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/70 via-black/40 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-neutral-900 via-neutral-900/20 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl tracking-tight mb-6\">Safe help selling vehicles from an estate</h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed mb-8\">When there's a lot to handle, let us take care of the vehicle sale. Disposing of vehicles from an estate is rarely just a practical matter. It often happens in a time marked by grief, responsibility, and many decisions in a short period. Our job is to make this part as simple, safe, and uncomplicated as possible.</p><div class=\"text-center md:text-left md:flex justify-between gap-4 items-center\"><a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"inline-block rounded-full border-2 border-white px-8 py-4 hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors font-medium text-lg cursor-pointer\">Get Contacted</a><p class=\"block text-neutral-400 text-sm mt-4 md:mt-0\">We typically respond within 1 business day.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-neutral-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6 text-center mb-16\">How We Help You</h2><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12\"><div><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6 group\"><img alt=\"A complete solution – whether it’s one or several vehicles\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\" src=\"/assets/estate-leads/1-15748d1d.jpg\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4\">A complete solution – whether it’s one or several vehicles</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">An estate can include everything from everyday cars to enthusiast vehicles, motorcycles, or other vehicles that need the right context to reach the right buyers. At Bidders Highway, we help you sell one or several vehicles at the same time, in a structured and professional way. You get a dedicated contact person and an end-to-end solution, from the first conversation to a completed sale.</p></div><div><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6 group\"><img alt=\"Fair market value with care and transparency\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\" src=\"/assets/estate-leads/2-d9ed760b.jpg\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4\">Fair market value with care and transparency</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">We always start with a thorough review and valuation of the vehicles. With extensive experience in online auctions and an engaged community of serious buyers, we create the conditions for a fair market value. All communication is transparent, and you have full insight throughout the process.</p></div><div><div class=\"relative h-64 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-6 group\"><img alt=\"We handle everything – on site with you\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\" src=\"/assets/estate-leads/3-7b937ba7.jpg\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4\">We handle everything – on site with you</h3><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">We help with photography, presentation, documentation, auction setup, and administration – and you always get a personal contact who guides you. Our goal is for the sale to feel safe, organized, and hassle-free. With our help, we prepare you for what to do for the estate and take care of the transfer of ownership and more.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6 text-center mb-12\">Professional Photos That Sell Your Collection</h2><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed text-center mb-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">We highlight paint, interior, and details – and show the complete picture. We work with professional photographers nationwide. Consistent photo style across all cars builds trust and drives bidding.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\"><img alt=\"Full shot – Mustang in setting (consistent style)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\" src=\"/assets/collection-leads-4-988657b9.webp\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\"><img alt=\"Group shot – multiple cars in the same setting (consistent style)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\" src=\"/assets/collection-leads-8-82d97edd.webp\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"relative h-80 rounded-lg overflow-hidden group\"><img alt=\"Interior – steering wheel, instruments, seats (show condition)\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\" src=\"/assets/collection-leads-9-4c7c40c2.webp\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 to-transparent\"></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-8 bg-racing-900 text-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"bg-racing-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-4 lg:py-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">200 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Visitors/month</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">30 000+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Registered users</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">150+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Images per auction</span></div><div class=\"text-center text-off-white\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold\">250 MSEK+</h3><span class=\"text-sm lg:text-base\">Bid volume/month</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-off-white text-black\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6 text-center mb-12 text-black\">Previous estate sales</h2><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-8 items-stretch\"><li><a href=\"/en/auctions/1939-citroen-berline-11-sport-cab-gjl052\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full bg-white\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/167a33995881d5c447da5dec57321750\" alt=\"1939 Citroën Berline 11 Sport Convertible\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1 text-black\">1939 Citroën Berline 11 Sport Convertible</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">This is a rare opportunity to acquire a 1939 Citroën Berline 11 Sport Convertible – a model seldom seen on the market in this condition. </p></div></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/auctions/ford-thunderbird-51\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full bg-white\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/4cbad35df21c5b0a904e3b1d14d56573\" alt=\"1956 Ford Thunderbird Convertible\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1 text-black\">1956 Ford Thunderbird Convertible</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">1950's luxury and style</p></div></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/auctions/1992-honda-nsx-30-cro615-1\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full bg-white\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/a9d7c84b4ecd347868df15f47fc6d2ef\" alt=\"1992 Honda NSX 3.0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1 text-black\">1992 Honda NSX 3.0</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">This 1992 Honda NSX presents a fantastic opportunity for any car enthusiast or collector to acquire a Swedish-sold, well-preserved example of one of the most sought-after Japanese sports cars of the 1990s.</p></div></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/auctions/custom-ford-rod-white-ice\" class=\"group block rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-neutral-200 hover:border-neutral-400 transition-colors h-full bg-white\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/24fe37dce8b27a0a670e0b8c461c8be4\" alt=\"1932 Custom Ford Rod White Ice\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transition-all duration-500 group-hover:brightness-110\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl tracking-tight mb-4 mb-1 text-black\">1932 Custom Ford Rod White Ice</h3><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base leading-snug text-neutral-700 mb-0\">Renowned build, 1932 Custom Ford Rod</p></div></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Frequently asked questions</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a href=\"/en/questions/do-you-sell-all-types-of-vehicles_ce6ea8d5-33d7-4846-abe4-a35eeec581da\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Do you sell all types of vehicles?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/questions/how-do-i-know-what-my-car-is-worth_bdc5f70a-41f0-40fe-b51e-51606067f611\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">How do I know what my car is worth?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/questions/can-i-advertise-my-car-on-other-marketplaces-while-my-auction-is-live_65a8c0f7-0f0c-4951-b1fe-0872d0d04f93\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Can I advertise my car on other marketplaces while my auction is live?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/questions/how-much-does-it-cost-to-sell-with-bidders-highway_dbe629ba-50fc-4283-9670-7e15e09ff9cf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">How much does it cost to sell with Bidders Highway?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li><li><a href=\"/en/questions/can-i-contact-the-seller-afterwards-if-the-auction-doesnt-reach-the-reserve-price_88e3dc61-9b37-4826-8f1a-370fe4a51120\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-3 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:bg-off-white rounded-lg transition-all group\"><span class=\"text-racing-900 group-hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Can I contact the seller afterwards if the auction doesn't reach the reserve price?</span><span class=\"icon text-jaffa text-lg flex-shrink-0 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\">arrow_forward</span></a></li></ul><div class=\"text-center mt-6\"><a href=\"/en/questions\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-jaffa hover:text-zest font-bold transition-colors\">View all questions and answers<span class=\"icon text-lg\">arrow_forward</span></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact-form\" class=\"py-16 md:py-24 bg-neutral-900\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight mb-6\">Contact Us</h2><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed\">Leave your contact details and we'll reach out for an initial conversation.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-8\" id=\"new_lead\" action=\"/en/estate-sales\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" method=\"post\"><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-2 font-medium\" for=\"lead_owner\">Name</label><input class=\"block w-full bg-black text-white border-0 border-b-2 border-neutral-700 rounded-sm focus:border-white focus:outline-none transition-colors py-3 px-2 placeholder:text-neutral-600\" placeholder=\"Contact person\" type=\"text\" name=\"lead[owner]\" id=\"lead_owner\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-2 font-medium\" for=\"lead_email\">E-mail</label><input class=\"block w-full bg-black text-white border-0 border-b-2 border-neutral-700 rounded-sm focus:border-white focus:outline-none transition-colors py-3 px-2 placeholder:text-neutral-600\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" required=\"required\" type=\"email\" name=\"lead[email]\" id=\"lead_email\"></div><div><label class=\"block text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-2 font-medium\" for=\"lead_phone\">Phone number</label><input class=\"block w-full bg-black text-white border-0 border-b-2 border-neutral-700 rounded-sm focus:border-white focus:outline-none transition-colors py-3 px-2 placeholder:text-neutral-600\" placeholder=\"+46 70 123 45 67\" required=\"required\" type=\"tel\" name=\"lead[phone]\" id=\"lead_phone\"></div><input name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"0\" autocomplete=\"off\"><input class=\"absolute -z-10\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\" name=\"lead[accept_terms]\" id=\"lead_accept_terms\"><div class=\"pt-6 text-center\"><input type=\"submit\" name=\"commit\" value=\"Get Contacted\" class=\"inline-block rounded-full border-2 border-white px-8 py-4 hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors font-medium text-lg text-white cursor-pointer w-full md:w-auto\" data-disable-with=\"Create Inquiry\"></div></form></div></section></div></main>",
